Sumantra passes guards and chamberlains --- Attendants announce Sumantra to Rāma and Sītā --- Sumantra finds Rāma anointed on golden couch --- Sumantra delivers Daśaratha and Kaikēyī summons --- Rāma tells Sītā consecration counsel awaits --- Sītā follows Rāma to door with blessings --- Rāma mounts blazing chariot with Lakṣmaṇa behind --- Citizens hail Rāma as coming ruler --- Rāma beholds jewel-rich crowded highway